      content: "Welcome to Campus Love WeChat Mini Program (the \"Service\"). This agreement is a contract between you and the operator of Campus Love (\"we\") regarding your use of the Service.\n\n1. Scope and Acceptance: By clicking \"Agree and continue\" or starting to use the Service, you are deemed to have fully understood and agreed to all terms of this agreement. If you do not agree, please do not use the Service.\n\n2. Account Registration: You must be at least 18 years old and a current university student or a recent graduate within 3 years, register with your real identity, and only one Service account can be registered per phone number or WeChat account. You must keep your account secure and may not lend, transfer, or sell it.\n\n3. User Conduct: You may not publish content that violates laws and regulations, endangers national security, spreads rumors, is obscene or pornographic, insults or defames others, contains advertising or malicious code; you may not impersonate others, engage in fraud, harass or threaten others, manipulate engagement metrics, or attack the Service's technical infrastructure.\n\n4. Content Standards: Content you publish must be original or legally authorized, and must not infringe on third-party intellectual property, portrait rights, privacy rights, or other legitimate rights. You grant us a non-exclusive, sub-licensable, royalty-free, worldwide, perpetual license to display, distribute, and promote within the Service.\n\n5. Service Description and Changes: We provide profile management, smart matching, chat, community posting, event registration, VIP membership, and virtual currency tipping. We may change or suspend the Service due to business adjustments, legal changes, or force majeure, with major changes announced 7 days in advance.\n\n6. Disclaimer: We are not liable for service interruptions or losses caused by force majeure, third-party service failures, user content authenticity, or private transactions between users.\n\n7. Intellectual Property: All code, interfaces, icons, copy, trademarks, and other intellectual property of the Service are owned by us or relevant rights holders, and may not be used for commercial purposes without written consent.\n\n8. Liability for Breach: Your violation of this agreement constitutes a breach, and we may take measures such as warning, restricting functionality, suspending service, permanent ban, or referring to public security authorities based on severity. You may appeal through the feedback center within 7 days.\n\n9. Agreement Changes: This agreement may change due to business adjustments, legal changes, or other reasons, with major changes requiring your consent via popup.\n\n10. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution: This agreement is governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China (excluding Hong Kong, Macau, and Taiwan). Disputes shall be resolved through negotiation first, and if negotiation fails, through litigation in a competent court at our registered location.\n\n11. Contact: Customer service email support@campuslove.example.com, hotline 400-xxx-xxxx (09:00-22:00).\n\nThis agreement v1.0.0 took effect on 2026-07-26. For the complete version, please view the \"User Agreement\" page in the mini program.",
